格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"让 DeepSeek Harness 人人可用的桌面入口——不用 Node、不用命令行，双击即用，还无损跟随每次官方更新。支持MacOs和Windows。DeepSeek Harness, for everyone. No Node.js. No command line. Just double-click and go. Always in step with every official update. For macOS & Windows.","id":"gh:1335759131","install_available":false,"language":"Rust","name":"dsh-launcher","slug":"Gru110110110/dsh-launcher","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","desktop-app","dsh","dsh-desktop","dsh-launcher","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-skill"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"让 DeepSeek Harness 人人可用的桌面入口——不用 Node、不用命令行，双击即用，还无损跟随每次官方更新。支持MacOs和Windows。DeepSeek Harness, for e"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"veryone. No Node.js. No command line. Just double-click and go. Always in step with every official u"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"pdate. For macOS & Windows."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Launcher"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Want to use DeepSeek Harness without first wrestling with Node, npm, and launch commands? DSH Launch"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"er is an unofficial desktop launcher built around the published `@deepseek-ai/dsh` package, with tha"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"t setup handled inside the app. Install it once, then double-click to prepare a verified, isolated r"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"untime, start the official `dsh web`, and open the original Harness Web UI in your chosen browser."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Launch management, updates, the plugin marketplace, remote access, and Desktop Pet all live in one w"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"indow. The managed runtime stays separate from your existing Harness data, and a failed deployment p"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"reserves the working environment."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Download the macOS or Windows build from the DSH Launcher website. Questions, bug reports, and ideas"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" are welcome in the QQ group `1121216833`."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Technical architecture, data-safety guarantees, and release details live in docs/IMPLEMENTATION.md."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Core features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Launch and manage DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The home page prepares and verifies the private Node.js/Harness runtime, starts or stops the officia"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"l service, shows its real address and uptime, and opens the official Web UI in the browser you choos"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"e. Harness and desktop updates are surfaced separately so you always know what is changing. If an up"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"date leaves an incompatible derived session index or third-party plugin, **Repair and start** rebuil"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ds the index from retained session logs and removes only identified incompatible plugins through rec"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"overable transactions. Finalized repair backups are automatically bounded by age, count, and total s"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ize and can be reviewed or cleaned in Settings."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The launcher verifies that the Web page responds before reporting a successful start and reports une"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"xpected service exits. If an update leaves the page unreachable, stop the service and roll back to t"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"he retained previous Harness version from the home page."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"If local file access fails during startup, the error shows the affected path when available so you c"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"an identify the blocked location. Windows stop and restart diagnostics remain available even when th"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"e service output connection closes."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Install plugins from the marketplace"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Search, filter, inspect, one-click install, and one-click uninstall Cordis and Skill plugins from a "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"validated marketplace snapshot. With a verified source and compatible package, one click installs th"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"e whole package group into the Harness Web environment, restarts an idle Harness, and checks that it"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"s page responds; confirmation appears only for a real source or compatibility warning. Registry pack"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ages are pinned to exact versions, while valid GitHub-only Cordis bundles are pinned to immutable co"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"mmits; ordinary repositories without a `dsh.bundle` manifest are blocked instead of being guessed as"},{"id":"p14s7","text":" npm packages. Skills that declare extra Python or npm dependencies show the reviewed command separa"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"tely after bundle installation: you can copy it, or explicitly approve a supported shell-free comman"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"d for the launcher to run; scripts, pipes, redirects, and chained commands remain copy-only. Uninsta"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"ll removes the recorded package group and its marketplace-recorded copies in older profiles, while p"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"reserving shared packages and existing configuration. Failed activation restores the previous enviro"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"nment. Older standalone copies offer a “Fix” action to install into Harness. When Harness has ongoin"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"Older standalone copies offer a “Fix” action to install into Harness. When Harness has ongoin [长行截断]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Keep a desktop pet beside your work"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Choose Mochi the marmot, Juzi the orange cat, or Bubbles the octopus."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The first-class Desktop Pet page lets you choose a companion, preview its five states, and control i"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ts size, speech bubble, motion, and mouse click-through behavior. The separate transparent always-on"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"-top pet window follows top-level Harness work in real time: idle, reasoning-only thinking, active w"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ork, waiting for you, or error. Rapid updates are coalesced and applied only between complete animat"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ion cycles, so state changes stay smooth without building a stale playback backlog. Its position and"},{"id":"p17s6","text":" preferences persist across launches, and the tray menu can show or hide it without reopening the ma"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"es persist across launches, and the tray menu can show or hide it without reopening the main window."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Use Harness from your phone"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Remote access exposes the loopback-only Harness Web UI through the launcher's authenticated proxy. I"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"t supports both older bare `dsh web` URLs and newer launch-token URLs without putting Harness's priv"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ate token into a remote link. Use a QR code and a rotatable 8-digit password on the same LAN (the co"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"mputer may use Ethernet or Wi-Fi), or explicitly enable a temporary Cloudflare quick tunnel for publ"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ic access; rotating the password immediately revokes existing sessions."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Configure the launcher in one place"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Settings keeps language, light/dark/system theme, the optional balance card, proxy mode and connecti"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"vity testing, desktop update checks, and project links together."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Product scope"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- macOS arm64 and x64 DMG installers\n- Windows x64 per-user NSIS installer; no portable ZIP\n- Pinned"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" Node.js 24.19.0, admitted only by platform-specific SHA-256\n- Exact `@deepseek-ai/dsh` installation"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" through the configured npm registries\n- A stable terminal `dsh` command backed by the launcher's pr"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"ivate runtime\n- Browser selection, system tray lifecycle, English/Simplified Chinese, and light/dark"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"/system themes\n- Plugin marketplace backed by the validated dsh-market snapshot; failed refreshes pr"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"eserve the last verified catalog\n- Separate Harness updates and cryptographically signed desktop upd"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"ates, with Default and Alpha Harness update channels and an explicit rollback action when the retain"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"ed previous runtime is available\n- Remote access with QR codes, rotatable passwords, and an optional"},{"id":"p23s9","text":" Cloudflare quick tunnel\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Business rules live in `dsh-core`, which has no Tauri dependency; Tauri owns only OS lifecycle, tray"},{"id":"p26s2","text":", clipboard, updater integration, and typed IPC. Process management, recovery, and data-safety behav"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ior are detailed in docs/IMPLEMENTATION.md."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
